													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 1567,
													"top": 40,
													"width": 271,
													"height": 2039,
													"stereotypeDisplay": "icon",
													"nameCompartment": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000lpAAAAAAAA"
													},
													"linePart": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000f4AAAAAAAA"
													}
												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLNoteView",
													"_id": "CTCWP20000khAAAAAAAA",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000ejAAAAAAAA"
													},
													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 1878,
													"top": 140,
													"width": 330,
													"height": 89,
													"text": "Precondition: the dispatcher queued a schedule (SD\n- Prepare Schedule). SystemTimeMessage arrives on\nthe CTC pipe and CtcNamedPipeReceiver calls\nSetSystemTimeAsync on the UI thread. CTC has no\nclock of its own."
												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLNoteView",
													"_id": "CTCWP20000kiAAAAAAAA",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000ejAAAAAAAA"
													},
													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 1878,
													"top": 304,
													"width": 330,
													"height": 68,
													"text": "Due means DepartureTime <= SystemTime (not ==), so\na skipped time update still releases the train.\nEntries are processed in departure order."
												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLNoteView",
													"_id": "CTCWP20000kjAAAAAAAA",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000ejAAAAAAAA"
													},
													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 1878,
													"top": 1371,
													"width": 330,
													"height": 89,
													"text": "After a successful release: CurrentBlockId = route\nstart block, active route = scheduled route, Phase\n= EnRoute. From here the location is inferred from\noccupancy (SD - Monitor Territory and Train\nOperations)."
												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLNoteView",
													"_id": "CTCWP20000kkAAAAAAAA",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000ejAAAAAAAA"
													},
													"font": "Arial;13;0",
													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 1878,
													"top": 1923,
													"width": 330,
													"height": 156,
													"text": "Dwell ends when SystemTime >= ReadyToDepartTime\n(actual arrival + dwell). If the suggestion send\nfails the train stays ready and is retried on the\nnext update (TrainMovementSuggestionFailed). Speed\nand authority are NOT recalculated when a train\nmerely moves from block to block: only at\ndispatch, dispatcher re-planning, and the start of\nthe next movement after a stop."
												},
												{
													"_type": "UMLSeqMessageView",
													"_id": "CTCWP20000f7AAAAAAAA",
													"_parent": {
														"$ref": "CTCWP20000ejAAAAAAAA"
