													"parentStyle": false,
													"left": 2383,
													"top": 1789,
													"width": 330,
													"height": 104,
													"text": "Only a MovementSuggestionMessage is ever sent\nhere, never another MovementRequestMessage. A\ndwell-only change never re-routes or sends; it\nshifts the planned departure (arrival + dwell) and\nso the speed of the next movement, which is sent\nwhen that movement starts."
												},
