															"width": 579,
															"height": 196,
															"text": "Implementation references:\n- MainWindow.xaml: \"Generate Schedule Template\" button -> GenerateTemplateCommand\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.GenerateTemplate()\n- TrainIds.NextAvailableNumber(CtcSystemState)\n- ScheduleTemplateFactory.Create() / GetRouteStartBlock()\n- ScheduleTemplate constructor\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.ShowTemplate() / ClearTemplate()\n- ScheduleTemplateRowViewModel(template, row)\n- DwellTimePolicy.GetDefaultDwellTime() -> ScheduleTemplateRow.DefaultDwellTime\n- DataGridTrainColumns: \"Arrival Time\" + \"Dwell (sec)\" column per train\n- ScheduleTimeCellViewModel.TimeText / DwellText\n- ScheduleTemplateRow.SetTrainTime() / TrySetTrainDwellTime()"
