															"width": 656.8173828125,
															"height": 61,
															"text": "Upload only loads the schedule into the builder for review: ICTCService.QueueSchedule() is NOT called here,\nthe dispatcher must still press Queue Schedule. If the dialog is cancelled (ShowDialog() != true) or the file\ncannot be read (IOException / UnauthorizedAccessException), the current template is kept."
														},
														{
															"_type": "UMLNoteView",
															"_id": "AAAAAAGhUJpucV+drZk=",
															"_parent": {
																"$ref": "AAAAAAGhUJpi6VzPqj0="
															},
															"font": "Arial;13;0",
															"parentStyle": false,
															"left": 60,
															"top": 1628,
															"width": 538,
															"height": 166,
															"text": "Implementation references:\n- MainWindow.xaml: \"Upload Schedule\" button -> UploadScheduleCommand\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.UploadSchedule()\n- Microsoft.Win32.OpenFileDialog.ShowDialog(), System.IO.File.ReadAllText()\n- TrainIds.NextAvailableNumber(CtcSystemState)\n- ScheduleCsvImporter.Import() / TryParseCsv()\n- ScheduleTemplateFactory.Create()\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.ShowTemplate() / ClearTemplate()\n- ScheduleTemplateRow.SetTrainTime() / TrySetTrainDwellTime()\n- DwellTimePolicy (default and validation of dwell times)"
														}
													]
												}
											],
											"documentation": "Implementation references:\n- MainWindow.xaml: \"Upload Schedule\" button -> UploadScheduleCommand\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.UploadSchedule()\n- Microsoft.Win32.OpenFileDialog.ShowDialog(), System.IO.File.ReadAllText()\n- TrainIds.NextAvailableNumber(CtcSystemState)\n- ScheduleCsvImporter.Import() / TryParseCsv()\n- ScheduleTemplateFactory.Create()\n- ScheduleBuilderViewModel.ShowTemplate() / ClearTemplate()",
