															"top": 1830,
															"width": 1118,
															"height": 61,
															"text": "Queueing does not dispatch a train. Each queued train is released later, time-triggered, when a SystemTimeMessage\nreaches its DepartureTime (CTCService.SetSystemTimeAsync() -> DispatchTrainAsync()); no dispatcher action is involved.\nAt dispatch the train's Active Movement Plan (DispatchedTrainState.Stops) is built from its timed blocks and their dwell times (MovementPlanner.CreateStops())."
														},
														{
															"_type": "UMLNoteView",
															"_id": "AAAAAAGhUJp7O2JM82Q=",
