															"width": 483,
															"height": 61,
															"text": "Blank dwell -> row.DefaultDwellTime (route start: 0 s); negative or\nnon-numeric -> conversion fails. Sets ScheduledRouteBlock.DwellTime\nof each stop; the stop's arrival time is not changed by its dwell."
														},
														{
															"_type": "UMLNoteView",
