															"top": 1068,
															"width": 524,
															"height": 76,
															"text": "Each span starts when the train DEPARTS its first timed block:\ntravel time = next arrival - (arrival + dwell). A dwell that\nleaves no travel time is rejected (SpeedPlanner.DwellConflictMessage),\ne.g. \"Train 000 dwells 300 s at A3 and does not depart until 12:06:00...\""
														}
