															"text": "WPF re-queries CanCloseSelectedBlock(), CanReopenSelectedBlock() and CanToggleSelectedBlockSwitch().\nAll require IsMaintenanceMode, so the Block Controls become usable for a suitable SelectedBlock.\nThe button text becomes \"Maintenance Mode: ON\"."
