															"text": "RequestedMaintenanceState = Open only means CTC successfully issued the request. The block stays confirmed Closed\n(and unsafe for authority, AuthorityManager.IsUnsafe()) until the Track Controller reports it Open in a later\nBlockStatusMessage, handled by CTCService.ApplyBlockStatus()."
