															"width": 528,
															"height": 61,
															"text": "// DispatchException, MessageSendException or ArgumentException:\n// CTC kept the train's previous plan. Everything is caught because this\n// runs from an async void command and must never crash the UI."
														},
														{
															"_type": "UMLNoteView",
