															"top": 7410,
															"width": 997,
															"height": 151,
															"text": "Logic view of the \"Update Dispatched Train Plan\" use case (pseudocode of the actual implementation).\nFragments: break = throw / return (rest of the method is skipped), alt = if/else, opt = if, loop = for.\nImplementation references:\n- MainWindowViewModel.CanApplyTrainPlan() / ApplyTrainPlanAsync() / OnCtcStateChanged() / RefreshDispatchedTrain() / LoadEditedPlan()\n- CTCService.UpdateMovementPlanStopAsync() / ReplaceActiveRoute() / OnStateChanged()\n- MovementPlanner.ValidateStopTiming() / RecalculatePlannedSpeeds() / ResolveRoute() / DepartureTimeAfter()\n- RouteManager.FindRoute(), SpeedPlanner.CalculateSpeedToTarget() / CalculateLegSpeed(), AuthorityManager.CalculateUpdatedAuthorityMeters()\n- DwellTimePolicy.GetDefaultDwellTime() / TryParseSeconds() / Validate(), ScheduleTemplateConverter.TryParseTime()\n- IMessageSender.SendAsync()"
														},
